OL,3,GNEWSABowling alley and motorway stop
OL,4,Aget TV makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilming for television drama Slow
OL,7,FHorses has helped provide improvements
OL,8,Fat a motorway service station and
OL,9,Fbowling alley.
OL,11,FGo Bowling in Dunstable, Bedfordshire,
OL,12,Fand Beaconsfield Services, on the M40
OL,13,Fin Buckinghamshire, both featured in
OL,14,Fthe fourth episode of the latest season
OL,15,Fof the Apple TV+ spy thriller which
OL,16,Fstars Sir Gary Oldman.
OL,18,FMotorway stop operator Extra MSA said
OL,19,Fincome from the production would fund
OL,20,Frefurbishments to its grounds and
OL,21,Ffacilities, including parking and
OL,22,Flandscaping.
